<view class="page">
  <view class="profile row start"><view class="avatar">🌱</view><view><view class="title">我的小日账</view><view class="subtitle">一笔一笔，记录自己的生活</view></view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{storageError}}" class="error">{{storageError}}</view>
  <view class="panel"><view class="row menu-item" bindtap="bills"><view>全部账单<view class="subtitle">{{count}} 笔日常记录</view></view><text class="arrow">›</text></view><view class="row menu-item" bindtap="categories"><view>分类管理<view class="subtitle">{{categoryCount}} 个分类，按自己的习惯调整</view></view><text class="arrow">›</text></view><view class="row menu-item" bindtap="backup"><view>导出与备份<view class="subtitle">CSV 导出 · JSON 备份与恢复</view></view><text class="arrow">›</text></view></view>
  <view class="panel"><view class="section-title">每月支出预算</view><view class="subtitle">给日常支出设一个参考金额，收入不抵扣预算用量</view><view class="row budget-form"><input class="input" type="digit" value="{{budget}}" maxlength="10" placeholder="预算金额（元）" bindinput="budgetInput" /><button class="primary small-button" bindtap="saveBudget">保存</button></view><view class="note">留空或填 0 可关闭预算。当前设置对每个月使用同一预算。</view></view>
  <view class="panel"><view class="section-title">数据保存在当前设备</view><view class="note">无需登录，不上传账单或资产。换设备、清理小程序数据前，请先导出 JSON 备份并保存到设备之外。文件恢复会替换全部收支与资产数据。</view></view>
  <view class="version">小日账 v1.2.0 · 认真记录，轻松生活</view>
</view>
